ra.\n87. 00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:04,645: Le recomiendo estas pastillas para la garganta.\n88. 00:06:05,845 --> 00:06:08,730: Tome una cada cuatro horas.\n89. 00:06:09,430 --> 00:06:12,920: ¿Puedo tomarlas con el estómago vacío?\n90. 00:06:13,870 --> 00:06:16,535: Mejor después de comer.\n91. 00:06:17,735 --> 00:06:20,125: Y beba mucha agua.\n92. 00:06:20,825 --> 00:06:23,105: ¿Y si no mejora?\n93. 00:06:24,055 --> 00:06:27,765: Si no mejora en tres días, vaya al médico.\n94. 00:06:28,965 --> 00:06:31,905: De acuerdo. ¿Cuánto le debo?\n95. 00:06:32,605 --> 00:06:35,215: Seis euros con veinte.\n96. 00:06:36,165 --> 00:06:38,170: Aquí tienes.\n97. 00:06:39,370 --> 00:06:41,540: Que se mejore.\n98. 00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:44,740: Gracias, muy amable.\n99. 00:06:52,690 --> 00:06:55,850: ¡Por fin! Pensaba que no venías.\n100. 00:06:57,050 --> 00:07:00,100: Perdona, llego tarde otra vez.\n101. 00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:04,015: No te preocupes. Acabo de llegar.\n102. 00:07:04,965 --> 00:07:08,620: Toma, tu paraguas. Me ha salvado la vida.\n103. 00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:12,265: ¿Qué tal la visita?\n104. 00:07:12,965 --> 00:07:15,960: Muy bien. El piso me encanta.\n105. 00:07:16,910 --> 00:07:19,025: ¿Y el precio?\n106. 00:07:20,225 --> 00:07:23,385: Un poco caro, pero vale la pena.\n107. 00:07:24,085 ... etc... Let's continue: I already have until maybe 136 lines.\n\nBut we have roughly up to 136 lines likely until the end.\n\nTo choose 20 phrases for intermediate.\n\nWe need to exclude names or places: many lines include names (Marcos, Lena, etc.) For intermediate level we can include some personal names but the spec says: \"Leave out a name used to address someone and keep the rest of the line.\" So phrases that are \"¡Lena! ¿Qué haces por aquí?\" we would remove the name: keep \"¿Qué haces por aquí?\" Possibly but then must stay within limit 12 words. That's acceptable.\n\nWe also need to exclude filler, sound descriptions etc. These lines are good.\n\nWe need to also keep a var